<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fr">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
    <title>{{ settings.siteName }} | Maintenance</title>
    {# Page autonome (sans importmap) : styles et polices de la charte 2026 en ligne. #}
    <style>
        @font-face { font-family: "Mouzambik"; src: url("{{ asset('fonts/mouzambik-regular.woff2') }}") format("woff2"); font-weight: 400; font-display: swap; }
        @font-face { font-family: "TT Commons"; src: url("{{ asset('fonts/tt-commons-regular.woff2') }}") format("woff2"); font-weight: 400; font-display: swap; }
        * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
        body { min-height: 100vh; display: flex; flex-direction: column; background: #111B14; color: #F3F2EE; font-family: "TT Commons", system-ui, sans-serif; }
        main { flex: 1; display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: center; gap: 28px; max-width: 760px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 48px 24px; }
        img { display: block; width: auto; height: 48px; }
        h1 { font-family: Mouzambik, Impact, "Arial Narrow", sans-serif; font-weight: 400; font-size: clamp(48px, 10vw, 112px); line-height: .9; text-transform: uppercase; }
        h1 span { color: #F7CA46; }
        p { max-width: 560px; font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.6; color: #B9C2BC; }
        .stripe { display: flex; height: 14px; }
        .stripe span { flex: 1; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <main>
        <img src="{{ asset('images/logo-benin-bouge-blanc.png') }}" alt="{{ settings.siteName }}" width="800" height="302">
        <h1>Site en maintenance.<br><span>On revient vite.</span></h1>
        <p>{{ settings.maintenanceMessage ?: "Le site est momentanément indisponible le temps d'une intervention. Merci de revenir un peu plus tard." }}</p>
    </main>
    <div class="stripe" aria-hidden="true"><span style="background:#3A8556"></span><span style="background:#F7CA46"></span><span style="background:#CF3732"></span><span style="background:#0E3F51"></span></div>
</body>
</html>
